WEBVTT

00:17.240 --> 00:19.320
-[burbling]
-[heart beating]

00:20.840 --> 00:23.640
[Nanno] We live in a world
where we strive for equality,

00:25.880 --> 00:29.480
but many people
don't take equal responsibility

00:29.560 --> 00:31.800
for the mistake they made together.

00:31.880 --> 00:33.240
[ominous music playing]

00:36.680 --> 00:40.320
Some choose to bear the consequences
of their actions,

00:44.000 --> 00:47.960
while some choose
to pretend to be blind to it.

00:49.240 --> 00:52.560
Because it's the option
that lets them off easy.

01:03.520 --> 01:05.680
They think they can forget
about the burden…

01:07.440 --> 01:09.680
they make other people carry.

01:10.800 --> 01:13.600
[theme music playing]

02:40.840 --> 02:41.720
Hello.

02:41.800 --> 02:45.080
I'm Nanno. It's nice to meet you all.

02:45.760 --> 02:47.360
-[sighs]
-[teacher] Hmm.

02:47.440 --> 02:49.160
Nanno, you can sit over…

02:49.240 --> 02:51.920
-[grunts]
-[students laugh]

02:52.000 --> 02:54.640
-There's a seat here next to me.
-[Jheng sighs]

02:54.720 --> 02:57.000
-[male student] Look at him.
-[Jheng] Some best friend.

02:57.080 --> 02:58.920
You just screw me over for a girl.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.160
Oh. [grunts]

03:00.240 --> 03:02.960
-You can sit at that desk over there.
-Thank you.

03:04.640 --> 03:06.320
See? Are you happy now?

03:06.400 --> 03:09.240
You ended up kicking me out of my seat
for nothing, you asshole.

03:09.760 --> 03:11.960
-You still don't get it.
-[sighs]

03:12.040 --> 03:13.640
If you can make her laugh…

03:14.360 --> 03:17.000
-you're on the right track.
-[chuckles]

03:17.080 --> 03:19.400
Did-- Did I make her laugh?

03:19.480 --> 03:21.360
-I did.
-Hmm.

03:23.120 --> 03:25.360
Hello, Nanno. I'm Lookmhee.

03:25.440 --> 03:27.280
[teacher] Clouds are made of water vapor.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.600
The droplets of…

03:29.720 --> 03:31.360
[Lookmhee] Oh, his name is Nanai.

03:31.440 --> 03:34.040
He's most likely
to be the next student president.

03:34.120 --> 03:35.320
Mm…

03:35.400 --> 03:36.920
Nanno, don't fall for him.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.840
Nanai's knocked up half the girls here.

03:38.920 --> 03:41.400
[teacher] …that then becomes the center
of the snow crystals…

03:41.480 --> 03:43.080
The school doesn't care?

03:44.200 --> 03:46.320
The girls had abortions. The thing is…

03:47.720 --> 03:50.000
he's still the most popular student.

03:50.080 --> 03:51.480
And no girl wants to come to school

03:51.560 --> 03:53.600
with a big belly
wearing maternity clothes.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.840
It's embarrassing.

03:55.880 --> 03:58.800
And I guess it's okay
as long as I don't get pregnant.

04:00.440 --> 04:04.040
[atmospheric music playing]

04:06.400 --> 04:08.160
[Lookmhee]
I invited her to join us for lunch,

04:08.240 --> 04:09.960
but she wanted to eat with him.

04:13.360 --> 04:14.200
Hey.

04:23.920 --> 04:25.280
Okay. Okay.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.760
[Jheng sucks teeth]

04:26.840 --> 04:27.840
[Pim] Well…

04:28.600 --> 04:30.480
if Nanai spoon-fed me like that…

04:31.240 --> 04:33.720
I really wouldn't
wanna eat with you either.

04:33.800 --> 04:34.920
-[Lookmhee scoffs]
-Yeah.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.480
Well, Pim, you're right.

04:37.440 --> 04:40.000
If I could have Nanno
spoon-feed me like that,

04:40.080 --> 04:42.800
I sure wouldn't be sitting here
with you. I'm so jealous.

04:42.880 --> 04:44.120
Go back and sit with them, then.

04:44.200 --> 04:45.440
-[Pim] Right.
-[Lookmhee] Go.

04:45.520 --> 04:49.080
Why are you kicking me out?
Those two just shooed me away. Jeez.

04:49.160 --> 04:50.440
[Jheng sighs]

04:50.520 --> 04:53.080
Just look at them.
There's no place for me there.

04:53.160 --> 04:54.320
It won't last.

04:54.400 --> 04:55.800
As soon as he gets in her pants,

04:55.880 --> 04:57.880
-he'll get bored and dump her.
-Hey.

04:59.440 --> 05:02.400
How many days… do you think?

05:03.640 --> 05:07.320
Jheng, when will you stop
making obscene bets like that?

05:08.240 --> 05:09.320
Five hundred baht each.

05:09.920 --> 05:12.560
Whoever guesses right
gets all the money. All of it.

05:12.640 --> 05:13.800
Uh…

05:13.880 --> 05:15.160
-Hold on.
-Damn.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.760
-See? My first client.
-[Pim] I'm in.

05:17.320 --> 05:18.760
Come on. You know it's just for fun.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.680
Yeah. That's right.

05:20.760 --> 05:23.200
You guys are disgusting and gross.

05:23.280 --> 05:25.280
I know. I'm a jerk, baby.

05:25.880 --> 05:28.320
-What do you say? Will you make a bet?
-[Lookmhee sighs]

05:29.840 --> 05:33.280
Well, I think this one
will be especially quick.

05:33.360 --> 05:34.560
-[Jheng cackles]
-[Pim chuckles]

05:34.640 --> 05:37.760
-I just made a bet for 500 baht, will you?
-Sure.

05:37.840 --> 05:39.560
[laughs]

05:39.640 --> 05:42.520
[upbeat music playing]

05:50.040 --> 05:52.400
-[students chattering]
-[Jheng] Anyone else wanna bet? Anyone?

05:52.480 --> 05:53.840
Anyone else? Hurry up.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.480
[female students screaming]

05:55.560 --> 05:56.920
[Nanai and Jheng grunt]

05:57.000 --> 05:59.440
-[Jheng groans]
-[female students cheering]

06:08.880 --> 06:10.320
[girl] Are you ready?

06:10.400 --> 06:13.200
-One, two, three. One, two…
-[camera shutter clicking]

06:13.280 --> 06:15.760
[upbeat music continues]

06:39.080 --> 06:40.840
[Petch retching]

06:42.840 --> 06:44.880
[toilet flushes]

06:53.600 --> 06:54.600
[sniffles]

07:08.400 --> 07:09.400
Hey.

07:16.080 --> 07:17.200
Do you know…

07:18.960 --> 07:22.680
that people in the school
are taking bets on you?

07:22.760 --> 07:24.600
They're betting on you and Nanai.

07:25.280 --> 07:28.120
Really? And what are they betting on then?

07:29.760 --> 07:30.920
Well…

07:32.920 --> 07:34.040
they're betting on…

07:34.640 --> 07:37.800
just how long it's going to take Nanai
to get in your pants.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.720
[faucet turns off]

07:44.040 --> 07:45.040
What about you?

07:45.840 --> 07:47.960
How long did it take him
to get into yours?

07:49.200 --> 07:50.600
[sighs, chuckles]

07:53.080 --> 07:55.760
I'm sorry for sticking my nose
in your business.

07:57.760 --> 07:59.680
I just don't want you to be a victim.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.520
[Petch sighs]

08:02.600 --> 08:06.080
If you think you're a victim,
that's what you'll be.

08:08.760 --> 08:10.120
[Petch exhales]

08:11.800 --> 08:13.160
[Petch chuckles]

08:15.840 --> 08:19.080
[ominous music playing]

08:24.680 --> 08:26.600
[both breathe heavily]

08:26.680 --> 08:29.440
Hold on.
How long have we known each other?

08:30.000 --> 08:32.760
-[in muffled voice] Four days.
-Give me the exact time.

08:33.680 --> 08:34.960
[Nanai sighs]

08:36.800 --> 08:41.120
[in normal voice]
Three days, three hours and 31 minutes.

08:41.800 --> 08:44.280
Then we still don't know each other
well enough.

08:46.960 --> 08:47.880
Nanno.

08:49.040 --> 08:50.320
You know that…

08:51.160 --> 08:52.840
love has nothing to do with time.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.240
It's like how I knew I liked you
since the first day.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.600
For you, Nanno…

09:02.280 --> 09:03.800
I'm willing to do anything.

09:05.360 --> 09:07.640
You'll do anything for me?

09:10.600 --> 09:13.080
-I promise.
-[chuckles]

09:13.160 --> 09:15.120
I still think this is too soon.

09:16.240 --> 09:17.880
How much more time do you need?

09:18.760 --> 09:19.840
Well…

09:20.920 --> 09:23.280
let's give it another minute.

09:29.680 --> 09:32.320
Ten, nine…

09:32.400 --> 09:35.080
eight, seven…

09:35.640 --> 09:37.880
six, five…

09:38.480 --> 09:39.720
four…

09:39.800 --> 09:41.920
three, two…

09:43.320 --> 09:44.400
one.

09:44.480 --> 09:45.520
[clock ticks]

09:46.240 --> 09:47.080
Zero.

09:47.760 --> 09:48.800
[moaning]

09:48.880 --> 09:50.560
[upbeat music playing]

09:52.560 --> 09:53.760
[Nanai grunts]

09:57.000 --> 09:58.680
[moans]

10:01.520 --> 10:03.600
[Jheng] What…

10:05.600 --> 10:08.160
Bro, did you get it done? Yeah?

10:08.880 --> 10:10.560
She didn't give you this hickey, huh?

10:11.680 --> 10:13.680
[laughs]

10:15.560 --> 10:20.720
-Three days, three hours, 33 minutes.
-[laughs]

10:20.800 --> 10:23.760
-New record.
-What a nice number.

10:24.560 --> 10:26.000
[Jheng] Here you go.

10:26.080 --> 10:27.960
-[indistinct chatter]
-[students cheer excitedly]

10:28.040 --> 10:30.800
-Jeez. That's a big pile of money.
-[students chatter]

10:30.880 --> 10:33.160
Dude, you should totally do
online betting.

10:33.240 --> 10:36.280
Where's the fun in that?
It's more fun to do it face-to-face.

10:36.360 --> 10:38.520
-[Pim] Do you see this?
-It's so much.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.960
Let's see who won. Come on.

10:40.040 --> 10:42.800
Since you're all so greedy,
let's see who won.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.560
I'll read out the guesses, eh.

10:44.640 --> 10:46.720
-Let's start with the first.
-[Lookmhee] Come on.

10:46.800 --> 10:48.680
Here's the first guess.

10:49.520 --> 10:52.280
Emitsu from room A.

10:52.360 --> 10:55.040
The guess is six days.

10:55.120 --> 10:56.520
-[all groan]
-[Lookmhee] What?

10:56.600 --> 10:58.200
-Not even close.
-[indistinct chatter]

10:58.280 --> 11:00.440
-I might have a chance to win.
-[Jheng] The next one.

11:00.520 --> 11:01.960
Tad's guess is…

11:02.800 --> 11:03.840
eight days…

11:03.920 --> 11:05.760
-[all groan]
-…and four hours.

11:05.840 --> 11:07.800
-[Nanno] What's going on?
-[Lookmhee gasps]

11:07.880 --> 11:10.240
-Uh… hey, Nanno.
-[object thuds]

11:14.680 --> 11:15.520
Uh…

11:16.080 --> 11:18.560
Everyone made a bet,
so I joined in just for fun.

11:18.640 --> 11:19.840
I'm sorry, Nanno.

11:20.440 --> 11:22.080
-Jheng.
-Huh?

11:22.160 --> 11:23.560
What was your guess?

11:25.400 --> 11:27.600
Uh… I… I don't know.

11:28.360 --> 11:30.520
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

11:30.600 --> 11:32.960
This is fun. Come on. Let me help.

11:36.160 --> 11:37.520
Hmm…

11:38.760 --> 11:40.120
Lookmhee.

11:41.000 --> 11:43.720
Your guess is three days and five hours.

11:44.320 --> 11:46.520
You're wrong, but you're pretty close.

11:47.640 --> 11:49.960
Do we have a closer guess, Jheng?

11:52.480 --> 11:54.480
[suspenseful music playing]

12:01.560 --> 12:04.920
"Three days, three hours and 33 minutes."

12:06.600 --> 12:09.560
[gasps] That's right. Who is that?

12:12.160 --> 12:13.640
It says Nanno.

12:14.640 --> 12:17.480
THREE DAYS, THREE HOURS, 33 MINUTES
NANNO

12:21.120 --> 12:22.160
[Nanno sighs]

12:22.240 --> 12:24.320
[ominous music playing]

12:26.880 --> 12:28.240
[Nanno] Thank you so much.

12:28.800 --> 12:32.160
Don't think that Nanai
is the only player in the school.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.920
I'm also a player.

12:36.440 --> 12:39.040
[students murmuring]

12:39.120 --> 12:40.760
[Jheng] Don't blame me for this.

12:43.120 --> 12:45.800
Look here, you just got played.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.640
[Nanai grunts]

12:53.720 --> 12:55.400
[Jheng laughs] Woo-hoo!

12:57.200 --> 12:58.400
Ooh.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.800
-Whoa!
-[yelps]

12:59.880 --> 13:01.200
[groans]

13:01.280 --> 13:03.640
[Jheng laughs]

13:03.720 --> 13:06.240
[Jheng]
How do you like that, asshole? Huh?

13:07.040 --> 13:10.640
Since you've been with Nanno,
you've lost some of your edge, Nai.

13:11.200 --> 13:13.240
Why? Did she suck you dry?
[chuckles]

13:15.160 --> 13:17.600
-[Nanai grunts]
-Hey. What's wrong? Hey.

13:18.320 --> 13:19.720
Let's just call it a day.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.600
Go see a doctor, dude.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.880
[pants]

13:24.960 --> 13:26.800
-Let's go again.
-[Jheng] Again?

13:27.920 --> 13:29.680
[exhales] Okay.

13:29.760 --> 13:31.880
Bring it on, you bastard. [chuckles]

13:31.960 --> 13:33.640
Whoo. Ah!

13:33.720 --> 13:34.560
[spits]

13:39.600 --> 13:40.680
[exhales]

13:40.760 --> 13:41.840
[huffs]

13:41.920 --> 13:44.000
[foreboding music playing]

13:45.280 --> 13:46.360
[door opens]

13:54.160 --> 13:57.080
What's wrong? Are you mad at me?

13:59.720 --> 14:00.720
[Nanno grunts]

14:02.320 --> 14:03.880
[Nanai breathes heavily]

14:06.920 --> 14:07.760
[Nanno gasps]

14:10.680 --> 14:12.840
[Nanai panting]

14:13.480 --> 14:15.320
[Nanno grunts]

14:16.240 --> 14:18.600
[Nanai breathes heavily]

14:23.720 --> 14:26.240
[Nanai panting]

14:32.400 --> 14:33.360
[Nanai] Huh? What?

14:33.920 --> 14:35.920
-What?
-What? Not in the mood?

14:36.000 --> 14:38.360
[Nanai grunting]

14:44.080 --> 14:45.240
Hey.

14:45.320 --> 14:49.080
If you can't even get it up,
we can do it another time.

14:49.760 --> 14:50.640
[grunts]

14:53.560 --> 14:55.240
[Nanno] You don't have to be embarrassed.

14:55.960 --> 14:57.880
We can have fun together next time.

15:00.560 --> 15:01.840
[exasperated sigh]

15:06.920 --> 15:07.840
[Nanno] Nanai!

15:07.920 --> 15:09.400
Nanai, but wait!

15:09.480 --> 15:12.040
-What just happened?
-[sighs]

15:12.120 --> 15:13.840
[Nanno sobs]

15:16.200 --> 15:17.320
I want to break up.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.880
I don't want to. No!

15:22.080 --> 15:25.520
What did I do wrong? I can change, Nanai.

15:26.680 --> 15:27.560
Nanno…

15:28.520 --> 15:30.480
-there's really no point.
-[Nanno sobs]

15:31.160 --> 15:32.680
I don't think this is working.

15:33.600 --> 15:35.320
[sobbing] But what did I do wrong?

15:36.400 --> 15:37.640
[exhales]

15:38.160 --> 15:40.240
-[Nanno sobs]
-You didn't do anything wrong.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.520
I just didn't like the way you look at me.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.640
[Nanno] What about my look?

15:51.160 --> 15:52.400
What did I do?

15:53.960 --> 15:56.240
I feel like you look at me like I'm an…

15:58.160 --> 15:59.000
object.

16:02.560 --> 16:04.280
I'm not asking you to understand me.

16:08.120 --> 16:09.280
Let's just break up.

16:09.360 --> 16:13.840
No! I'm gonna die if we break up!
I swear, Nanai.

16:15.040 --> 16:15.880
Nanno…

16:17.240 --> 16:19.120
we were just having a little fun.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.360
Didn't we both enjoy it?

16:23.520 --> 16:24.680
[sobs]

16:28.200 --> 16:29.280
[huffs]

16:29.360 --> 16:31.640
[Nanno cackles]

16:32.520 --> 16:33.880
[inhales deeply]

16:34.480 --> 16:36.320
[sighs]

16:36.400 --> 16:38.960
[ominous music playing]

16:40.240 --> 16:41.520
Don't look so shocked.

16:42.280 --> 16:44.640
Didn't all the girls you've been with
make a little scene?

16:46.080 --> 16:47.800
I thought you would like it,

16:47.880 --> 16:49.400
so I did it for you.

16:50.560 --> 16:53.160
I wanted to make you feel like a man.

16:56.120 --> 16:58.320
You said I made you feel like an object.

16:59.200 --> 17:01.680
Didn't you do the exact same thing to me?

17:01.760 --> 17:03.160
I don't see a difference.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.640
I'm sorry,

17:11.960 --> 17:14.040
but I don't feel anything at all.

17:16.200 --> 17:18.440
Maybe after today…

17:19.120 --> 17:21.360
you'll start to feel something
deep inside.

17:21.880 --> 17:24.760
[upbeat music playing]

17:34.000 --> 17:37.080
[background chatter]

17:57.280 --> 17:58.760
You're a strange girl, Nanno.

17:59.280 --> 18:02.440
I thought you'd be like the other girls
that Nanai dated.

18:03.520 --> 18:04.960
You're a strange girl too.

18:08.800 --> 18:09.960
[sighs]

18:11.520 --> 18:13.480
You would do the same thing
if you were me.

18:16.600 --> 18:18.880
You still don't know me well enough.

18:22.600 --> 18:24.040
[Petch exhales]

18:30.040 --> 18:31.520
I didn't think I could do it.

18:33.280 --> 18:36.040
Then I realized
he wasn't gonna take responsibility.

18:38.200 --> 18:41.080
I took an abortion pill,
but it didn't work.

18:44.560 --> 18:46.280
Were you happy or sad about it?

18:48.520 --> 18:49.920
[chuckles]

18:50.000 --> 18:51.920
It was probably the first time ever…

18:52.600 --> 18:54.480
I was glad to fail at something.

18:56.840 --> 19:01.080
Don't you want the guy who knocked you up
to take responsibility?

19:05.640 --> 19:07.680
[ominous music playing]

19:10.200 --> 19:12.240
[water trickling]

19:13.160 --> 19:14.000
Boo!

19:14.080 --> 19:15.800
-What the fuck!
-[Jheng laughs]

19:16.280 --> 19:18.360
-You're an asshole.
-Can I borrow your shampoo, Nai?

19:18.440 --> 19:20.680
-Get out of my face, you fuck.
-[chuckles]

19:21.760 --> 19:23.600
Holy shit, dude.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.960
[Jheng] Is your dick getting smaller?
[laughs]

19:26.040 --> 19:28.440
Smaller, my ass.
My dick's still bigger than yours, man.

19:28.520 --> 19:29.560
[Jheng cackles]

19:34.200 --> 19:35.680
[suspenseful music]

19:36.240 --> 19:39.720
[Lookmhee breathing heavily]

19:55.200 --> 19:56.760
-[screams]
-Huh?

19:59.400 --> 20:00.280
Shit.

20:00.920 --> 20:02.160
[gasps]

20:04.360 --> 20:07.840
[foreboding music playing]

20:21.640 --> 20:23.680
[dad] Why are you wearing a jacket?
What's the matter?

20:23.760 --> 20:24.920
Are you sick?

20:25.840 --> 20:28.680
I'm just a little cold. I'm fine.

20:28.760 --> 20:33.040
Do you want to see someone? I'll take you.
I have a friend who's a doctor.

20:35.160 --> 20:37.920
Eat this, then. It's your favorite.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.800
[retching]

20:53.440 --> 20:54.600
What's wrong, Nanai?

20:55.320 --> 20:57.520
[Nanai] This is disgusting. It's gross.

20:59.680 --> 21:01.400
[mom] I didn't do anything different.

21:02.320 --> 21:04.760
Are you sick?
Should I take you to the doctor?

21:04.840 --> 21:08.160
I said I'm fine, Mom.
It's your shitty cooking.

21:09.840 --> 21:12.840
[gagging]

21:14.000 --> 21:14.840
[Nanai retches]

21:16.520 --> 21:17.520
[Lookmhee] The other day,

21:17.600 --> 21:18.920
we were in the middle of…

21:19.840 --> 21:20.800
doing it, you know,

21:20.880 --> 21:22.760
-and he opened his shirt.
-Nanai?

21:22.840 --> 21:26.360
[whispering] Shh. Keep it down.
Shit, here he comes.

21:27.280 --> 21:31.480
Nanai, you're here in class early.
[chuckles]

21:31.560 --> 21:34.360
Do you want to practice today?
Tryouts are coming up.

21:35.840 --> 21:39.080
Come on. Just let the coach see your face
so he stops complaining.

21:39.160 --> 21:40.720
He's getting on my nerves.

21:42.800 --> 21:44.120
[retching]

21:44.800 --> 21:45.800
[Jheng] Shit.

21:46.280 --> 21:47.480
Hey! Hey.

21:48.800 --> 21:50.160
Hey, what's wrong with you?

21:50.760 --> 21:52.440
[retches]

21:52.520 --> 21:54.640
-Take it easy.
-[puffs]

21:55.120 --> 21:57.080
Dude, is your belly bigger?

21:57.160 --> 21:59.160
Fuck off! Just leave me alone,
you asshole!

22:01.400 --> 22:02.600
[Jheng] What's with that jerk?

22:02.680 --> 22:04.360
-See?
-[Jheng] Is he mad I called him fat?

22:04.440 --> 22:06.480
[ominous music playing]

22:10.680 --> 22:11.880
Shit.

22:12.600 --> 22:15.720
-[girl] Are you ready? One, two, three.
-[camera shutter clicks]

22:17.520 --> 22:18.920
Turn a bit to the right.

22:19.640 --> 22:21.480
One, two, three.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.720
Here you go.

22:28.800 --> 22:29.880
Thank you.

22:44.200 --> 22:46.680
[Nanai breathes heavily]

22:58.680 --> 23:00.920
[both panting]

23:04.960 --> 23:07.400
-[screams]
-Shit.

23:09.480 --> 23:10.520
Fuck.

23:13.320 --> 23:14.520
[ominous music playing]

23:16.920 --> 23:19.840
[monitor beeping]

23:19.920 --> 23:21.800
[background chatter]

23:23.960 --> 23:25.600
What's wrong with me? What do you see?

23:29.400 --> 23:32.040
Have you ever had sex reassignment surgery

23:32.120 --> 23:34.200
or a transgender procedure?

23:34.720 --> 23:35.960
Mm-mm.

23:38.760 --> 23:40.800
I want you to look right here
at the monitor.

23:44.960 --> 23:46.080
What's that?

23:46.560 --> 23:50.280
Well, I think your case is extremely rare.

23:55.040 --> 23:56.200
I think you're pregnant.

23:56.280 --> 23:57.920
[foreboding music playing]

23:58.000 --> 23:59.120
Are you insane?

23:59.680 --> 24:01.920
How can I be pregnant? I'm a man.

24:03.040 --> 24:04.080
Sir…

24:05.000 --> 24:06.640
if you don't believe me

24:07.240 --> 24:09.600
you can get a second opinion
somewhere else.

24:10.960 --> 24:12.520
[doctor] You may be a hermaphrodite

24:12.600 --> 24:16.840
who was born with both male
and female reproductive organs.

24:19.040 --> 24:20.240
It's a girl.

24:21.480 --> 24:23.080
Judging from the size,

24:23.640 --> 24:26.160
you're about 15 to 16 weeks pregnant.

24:28.560 --> 24:32.080
The baby is healthy.
You can see her heart beating.

24:35.960 --> 24:37.000
Mm.

24:38.440 --> 24:41.520
[monitor beeping]

24:46.960 --> 24:48.040
Whoa!

24:50.040 --> 24:51.160
It's moving.

24:54.120 --> 24:56.320
Hmm. That's the baby.

25:00.480 --> 25:02.520
[ominous music playing]

25:02.600 --> 25:05.040
[heart beating]

25:05.120 --> 25:07.480
[Tik] I pulled Nanai into the darkroom.

25:08.080 --> 25:10.720
It was very dark in there, right?

25:10.800 --> 25:15.120
I was going down on him and I saw it.
His stomach was huge.

25:15.200 --> 25:16.440
-I was shocked.
-[grunts]

25:17.080 --> 25:18.800
-Nai. Nai!
-[Nanai exhales]

25:18.880 --> 25:20.440
[Jheng] Come on, Nai!

25:21.440 --> 25:23.280
Nai, wait for me.

25:23.360 --> 25:24.200
Fuck you!

25:24.280 --> 25:27.240
-Can't you just mind your own business?
-What…

25:28.120 --> 25:30.440
-Uh…
-You were gossiping about me.

25:31.240 --> 25:35.360
People were talking and I was listening.
You're mad at me, huh?

25:36.360 --> 25:38.080
Just tell me what's wrong with you,

25:38.160 --> 25:40.200
so I don't have to hear it
from other people.

25:42.480 --> 25:44.240
Most STDs can be cured these days.

25:44.320 --> 25:47.280
Don't worry.
I can take you to a health clinic, okay?

25:47.360 --> 25:50.320
Fuck you. I don't have a disease.
I'm pregnant!

25:50.400 --> 25:52.920
[Nanno] Nanai, smile for the camera.

25:55.560 --> 25:57.360
[grunts]

25:57.440 --> 25:59.240
Hey. [sighs]

26:00.720 --> 26:02.160
[Jheng exhales]

26:02.640 --> 26:05.120
[students chattering]

26:05.200 --> 26:07.240
[Nanai]
I don't have a disease. I'm pregnant!

26:09.240 --> 26:11.840
[Nanai]
I don't have a disease. I'm pregnant!

26:11.920 --> 26:14.960
I don't have a disease.
I'm just… just an asshole.

26:15.040 --> 26:15.880
[laughs]

26:15.960 --> 26:17.680
Serves him right.
That player had it coming.

26:19.760 --> 26:22.200
[Mouy] I'm afraid it's just not possible.

26:23.160 --> 26:25.160
You can't run for student president.

26:26.040 --> 26:28.160
[Nanai vomits]

26:29.560 --> 26:31.160
[Nanai coughs]

26:46.120 --> 26:47.720
[ominous music playing]

26:53.600 --> 26:55.600
[Lookmhee] How are you feeling, Nanai?

26:56.160 --> 26:57.240
Are you sad?

27:05.160 --> 27:07.160
Why don't you try to be positive?

27:07.240 --> 27:10.520
It might just be a tumor.
That's what you told me once.

27:12.600 --> 27:14.080
[gasps]

27:15.760 --> 27:17.640
[shudders]

27:21.960 --> 27:23.840
I hope you're really pregnant.

27:23.920 --> 27:26.600
You'll finally understand
what I have to go through.

27:28.680 --> 27:29.720
[girl bangs on the table]

27:29.800 --> 27:32.280
We both liked it when we were doing it.

27:33.040 --> 27:35.640
How come you dumped me
once I got pregnant?

27:40.200 --> 27:42.120
-[pills rattle]
-[gasps]

27:42.200 --> 27:45.640
"Why don't you take the abortion pill?"
That's what you told me to do.

27:46.280 --> 27:47.640
There are risks, you know.

27:51.520 --> 27:53.560
[shudders]

27:56.280 --> 27:57.320
[gasps]

27:57.400 --> 27:59.960
Do you remember when you took me
to get an abortion?

28:00.040 --> 28:02.960
It sure didn't bother you
to go there then, did it?

28:03.040 --> 28:06.240
If you want me to,
I can take you to the same place.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.640
[grunts]

28:12.560 --> 28:14.960
[shuddering]

28:17.280 --> 28:18.480
[Nanai exhales]

28:18.960 --> 28:20.920
-Congratulations on having a girl.
-[gasps]

28:22.800 --> 28:24.000
[smooch]

28:24.080 --> 28:26.880
[suspenseful music playing]

28:28.360 --> 28:32.440
[baby crying echoes]

28:33.880 --> 28:34.720
[grunts]

28:34.800 --> 28:36.080
[gasps]

28:36.160 --> 28:37.080
[thuds]

28:38.200 --> 28:39.760
[breathes heavily]

28:39.840 --> 28:41.080
[clicks tongue]

28:42.840 --> 28:44.320
[exhales]

28:45.760 --> 28:47.040
[sniffles, sighs]

29:03.440 --> 29:04.440
[Jheng] Hey, Nai.

29:04.520 --> 29:07.000
-Hey, Nai, where are you going?
-[Nanno] Why are you avoiding me?

29:07.800 --> 29:09.440
You can say hi to me.

29:10.480 --> 29:12.800
I'm not put off by the fact
that you're pregnant.

29:13.480 --> 29:16.520
But I can't speak for everyone else,
you know?

29:20.840 --> 29:21.880
Hey, Nai!

29:23.040 --> 29:26.080
[dramatic music playing]

29:44.520 --> 29:46.160
I LIKE JUDO.

29:46.240 --> 29:49.800
IT'D BE NICE IF WE COULD THROW DOWN
ALL OBSTACLES IN LIFE.

30:01.120 --> 30:02.400
[knocking on door]

30:02.480 --> 30:03.560
[dad] Nai.

30:05.040 --> 30:07.600
Nai, come out here and talk to me.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.880
Just leave me alone, please.

30:10.640 --> 30:13.440
[dad] I saw it on the Internet.
Are you pregnant?

30:14.280 --> 30:15.320
What did you do?

30:16.880 --> 30:19.760
What kind of man goes
and gets himself pregnant?

30:19.840 --> 30:20.920
Come out and answer me.

30:21.400 --> 30:23.480
-[object thuds]
-[exhales]

30:24.200 --> 30:26.080
If you're not gonna help,
then just shut up.

30:26.160 --> 30:28.440
Do you have any idea
how many times I needed to…

30:28.960 --> 30:30.400
dig you out of a mess?

30:32.000 --> 30:34.160
-[dad] You're nothing but trouble.
-[mom] That's enough.

30:36.040 --> 30:37.680
[dad] I don't care what disease you have,

30:38.720 --> 30:41.800
just take my money
and take care of it right now.

30:42.320 --> 30:45.040
If you can't, don't bother coming back!

30:46.840 --> 30:49.040
So typical, huh?

30:49.120 --> 30:50.920
-You only care about yourself!
-Punk.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.040
Huh? Huh?

30:52.120 --> 30:54.880
You forced your secretary
to get an abortion!

30:54.960 --> 30:56.400
Did I say anything then?

31:03.120 --> 31:05.320
[crying]

31:05.400 --> 31:08.200
[somber music playing]

31:30.520 --> 31:31.800
[exhales]

31:37.640 --> 31:39.320
[flies buzzing]

31:46.240 --> 31:47.680
[sighs]

31:49.640 --> 31:50.720
[huffs]

31:55.040 --> 31:59.080
[chokes, coughs]

31:59.720 --> 32:00.960
[grunts]

32:01.480 --> 32:02.720
Fuck!

32:04.120 --> 32:06.480
[groans, grunts]

32:06.560 --> 32:08.320
[coughing]

32:09.200 --> 32:10.840
[coughs, grunts]

32:11.680 --> 32:13.040
[groaning]

32:14.280 --> 32:16.360
[gasping]

32:18.720 --> 32:20.200
Oh.

32:21.640 --> 32:25.400
[somber music continues]

32:35.640 --> 32:37.920
[vomits]

32:38.800 --> 32:41.680
[breathing heavily]

32:48.360 --> 32:50.840
[retching]

32:54.920 --> 32:56.200
[gasping]

32:59.320 --> 33:00.200
[inhales sharply]

33:00.280 --> 33:01.720
[pills rattle]

33:08.400 --> 33:09.800
[wheezing]

33:10.680 --> 33:13.280
[retching]

33:16.120 --> 33:18.120
[grunts]

33:25.440 --> 33:26.880
[grumbles]

33:31.000 --> 33:32.240
[gasping]

33:35.440 --> 33:37.120
Fuck! It hurts!

33:46.040 --> 33:47.520
[gasps]

33:47.600 --> 33:49.920
[panting]

33:59.640 --> 34:01.040
[grunts]

34:14.240 --> 34:17.800
[ominous music playing]

34:25.160 --> 34:27.600
[crying]

34:28.440 --> 34:30.320
-[knocking on door]
-[gasps]

34:32.720 --> 34:34.200
-[heaves]

34:34.280 --> 34:35.920
[knocking on door continues]

34:39.280 --> 34:41.080
[pants]

34:41.160 --> 34:43.800
[grunts]

35:02.120 --> 35:04.600
[wind gusting eerily]

35:22.640 --> 35:24.040
[gasps]

35:25.280 --> 35:29.480
DO YOU KNOW HOW YOU GOT PREGNANT?

35:30.440 --> 35:34.840
WHO WAS THE LAST PERSON YOU BANGED
BEFORE YOU GOT PREGNANT?

35:34.920 --> 35:36.240
[gasps]

35:36.320 --> 35:38.720
[foreboding music playing]

35:41.000 --> 35:42.080
[gasps]

35:53.680 --> 35:54.520
Hey.

35:56.000 --> 35:59.840
Nanai, I almost didn't recognize you
with your new look.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.640
What did you do to me?

36:03.120 --> 36:04.040
Do what?

36:05.080 --> 36:06.960
We were just fooling around.

36:07.520 --> 36:10.720
It was a casual hookup that…
we both enjoyed.

36:10.800 --> 36:12.320
Didn't we both enjoy it?

36:15.440 --> 36:18.200
-Mm-hmm.
-Nanno. Nanno!

36:18.960 --> 36:21.800
[somber music playing]

36:35.560 --> 36:36.680
[Nanai] Petch.

36:41.400 --> 36:42.240
Petch.

36:46.760 --> 36:47.840
Nanai?

36:58.200 --> 36:59.600
[sobs]

37:01.080 --> 37:02.000
Petch.

37:05.200 --> 37:07.440
I'm sorry. [cries]

37:09.480 --> 37:11.400
[Nanai] I'm sorry for everything.

37:13.040 --> 37:15.040
I understand how you feel now.

37:18.040 --> 37:19.960
I'm sorry I made you look bad.

37:20.040 --> 37:21.440
[bittersweet music playing]

37:21.520 --> 37:24.280
I'm sorry I left you
to go through this alone.

37:24.360 --> 37:25.320
[sobs]

37:27.600 --> 37:29.960
I'm sorry I put you in this situation.

37:34.120 --> 37:35.800
[Nanai sobbing]

37:36.480 --> 37:38.360
It happened a long time ago, Nanai.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.920
I'm not mad at you anymore.

37:48.080 --> 37:49.920
[Petch] You don't have to apologize.

37:55.840 --> 37:59.040
I guess we were both to blame
for what happened back then.

38:04.880 --> 38:06.160
-[Nanai sniffles]
-[sighs]

38:07.240 --> 38:08.440
Besides…

38:10.880 --> 38:12.840
I'm happy with the decision I made.

38:14.120 --> 38:14.960
It's fine.

38:20.160 --> 38:22.800
[bittersweet music rising]

38:47.080 --> 38:48.560
[Petch] Good luck, Nanai.

38:54.680 --> 38:57.520
[Nanai crying]

39:11.440 --> 39:14.600
[bittersweet music soaring]

39:20.240 --> 39:22.440
[grunting]

39:27.600 --> 39:28.920
[groans]

39:34.240 --> 39:37.200
[baby crying]

39:56.360 --> 39:57.640
This will hurt a little.

39:58.160 --> 39:59.000
Hold still.

40:01.640 --> 40:04.120
-[grunts]
-It will be over soon.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.480
-[groans]
-Okay.

40:10.440 --> 40:11.600
[exhales]

40:16.600 --> 40:18.880
-[huffs]
-[metal clanks]

40:18.960 --> 40:19.960
[inhales deeply]

40:20.040 --> 40:21.360
[puffs]

40:22.400 --> 40:24.960
[monitor beeping]

40:26.360 --> 40:29.400
[panting]

40:29.480 --> 40:31.560
-[suspenseful music]
-Hmm.

40:31.640 --> 40:32.680
Don't worry.

40:33.240 --> 40:34.320
[gasps]

40:34.400 --> 40:36.640
You'll wake up in no time.

40:36.720 --> 40:38.480
-[cackles]
-[gasps]

40:38.560 --> 40:39.680
[laughing hysterically]

40:39.760 --> 40:40.800
[whimpers]

40:46.040 --> 40:48.960
-[monitor beeping]
-[inhales deeply]

40:50.000 --> 40:52.640
[groans, exhales]

40:53.120 --> 40:56.240
-[beeping continues]
-[sighs]

40:58.720 --> 41:00.080
[huffs]

41:03.360 --> 41:05.520
Ooh. What the hell is that?

41:07.360 --> 41:08.360
It's your baby.

41:11.200 --> 41:12.360
-What?
-Mm.

41:12.920 --> 41:13.840
Hey. Hey, hey.

41:13.920 --> 41:16.000
-But I paid you to get rid of the baby.
-[doctor] Hmm.

41:16.080 --> 41:19.400
I was only a few months pregnant.
I don't understand.

41:19.920 --> 41:23.120
As you can see,
you carried it for the full term.

41:23.200 --> 41:25.840
This here is a healthy baby
and it's yours to take care of.

41:25.920 --> 41:27.120
But…

41:29.800 --> 41:31.240
but I paid you…

41:33.880 --> 41:35.640
to get rid of this baby.

41:38.360 --> 41:39.880
If you really want her killed…

41:41.960 --> 41:43.280
you can do it yourself.

41:43.760 --> 41:44.800
[baby coos]

41:47.160 --> 41:48.200
[baby crying]

41:49.400 --> 41:52.160
[crying continues]

41:53.920 --> 41:55.320
[sighs]

41:55.400 --> 41:56.560
[baby coos]

41:58.520 --> 42:02.320
[baby crying]

42:04.280 --> 42:05.240
[Nanai sighs]

42:05.320 --> 42:07.760
[baby crying]

42:11.680 --> 42:13.200
[grunts]

42:13.280 --> 42:16.360
[baby crying]

42:19.440 --> 42:22.120
[baby coos]

42:22.200 --> 42:24.360
[tense music playing]

42:33.640 --> 42:36.400
[tense music continues]

42:40.880 --> 42:42.040
[baby coos]

42:44.880 --> 42:46.760
[grunts, groans]

42:48.320 --> 42:51.040
[baby coos]

42:51.560 --> 42:53.040
[sobbing]

42:55.400 --> 42:57.520
[sobs]

43:02.480 --> 43:03.520
[chuckles]

43:04.600 --> 43:06.280
[baby coos]

43:07.400 --> 43:09.600
[chuckles]

43:11.400 --> 43:12.920
[sobs]

43:13.800 --> 43:17.320
[bittersweet music playing]

43:19.440 --> 43:21.560
[sobbing]

43:33.720 --> 43:36.400
[laughing softly]

43:38.040 --> 43:39.040
[sobs]

43:43.440 --> 43:46.680
[baby crying]

43:55.560 --> 43:58.200
[baby coos]

43:59.920 --> 44:01.560
[sobs]

44:01.640 --> 44:03.240
I'm sorry.

44:09.840 --> 44:12.160
[sniffling]

44:13.760 --> 44:15.560
-[knocking on door]
-[gasps]

44:21.280 --> 44:22.400
[gasping]

44:22.480 --> 44:23.320
Nanno.

44:31.920 --> 44:33.200
What a cute baby.

44:36.280 --> 44:37.280
Nanno.

44:38.280 --> 44:39.640
I'm sorry for what I did.

44:41.080 --> 44:42.640
Please, I can be a better man.

44:44.360 --> 44:45.200
Nanno…

44:46.640 --> 44:47.960
will you come back to me?

44:53.280 --> 44:56.240
No, thanks. I'm only here to visit you.

44:59.320 --> 45:00.960
I brought you a gift.

45:04.480 --> 45:05.320
Why?

45:06.160 --> 45:08.080
But, why did you come here?

45:09.040 --> 45:10.840
To see if you're a good father.

45:11.400 --> 45:13.880
Or I should say a good mother?

45:14.360 --> 45:15.960
You've put my mind at ease.

45:16.960 --> 45:18.200
[Nanai] Nanno.

45:18.280 --> 45:20.600
Nanno. Nanno. Don't go, Nanno.

45:20.680 --> 45:22.800
Nanno, Nanno, Nanno, stay with me.

45:43.400 --> 45:44.880
LOL

45:44.960 --> 45:48.480
[ominous music playing]

46:59.720 --> 47:02.880
[closing theme music playing]
